<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - Tarrant Cty, Texas, Jr. Coll. GOs.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - Tarrant Cty, Texas, Jr. Coll. GOs.</headline>
<text>
<p>TARRANT COUNTY JUNIOR COLLEGE DISTRICT</p>
<p>RE: $9,670,000</p>
<p>(FORT WORTH, TEXAS)</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION REFUNDING AND</p>
<p>IMPROVEMENT BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>First Southwest Company</p>
<p>Estrada Hinojosa &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
